# try does NOT catch ResourceLimitExceeded (E043) — system-level limits propagate.
# This verifies the non-catchable semantics: try wrapping collect on an infinite range
# still surfaces the resource limit error rather than wrapping it in Variant(Error, ...).
# ResourceLimitExceeded (E043) fires at 1M elements for collect.
# (Note: DepthExceeded (E040) was removed in B-314 / T-908.)
[try [fn [] [collect [range 0]]]]
